[29.3041, "o", "▸ $ python3 -m pytest tests/ -v\r\n"]
[29.9065, "o", "  └ exit 0 · 17 lines\r\n"]
[32.5509, "o", "\r\n"]
[32.6689, "o", "The discount tests were failing because:\r\n"]
[33.1228, "o", "1. The BULK discount required `total > BULK_MINIMUM` (strictly greater) but should apply at the minimum (5000 cents).\r\n"]
[33.3502, "o", "2. The BULK discount calculation returned the discount amount instead of the discounted price.\r\n\r\n"]
[33.7599, "o", "Fixed by changing the condition to `total >= BULK_MINIMUM` and computing the discounted price as `total * (1 - RATES[code])`.\r\n\r\n"]
[33.9496, "o", "All tests now pass. Verified with `python3 -m pytest tests/ -v`.\r\n"]
[33.9498, "o", "\r\n✓ 1 read · 1 lookup · 1 edit · 3 commands · 26s · ↑23.2k ↓1.2k · ctx 3%\r\n\r\n"]
